<urn:atm:triage:finding/AV1A-M4>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AV1A-M4" ;
  triage:title "async-mailbox-reader boundary io_forbidden copies the write-store baseline; RO guarantee lives only in a runtime test" ;
  triage:description "boundaries/atm-storage/async-mailbox-reader.toml (and -sqlite.toml) io_forbidden copies the write-store baseline verbatim; sprint doc D1a asks for a write-capable-connection restriction, so the read-only guarantee lives only in the A3 runtime test, not the boundary lint. Add the restriction to the boundary record / lint. boundary-guard." ;
